<title>MOLDOVA: Moldova inflation growth slows to 1.4 pct in Nov.</title>
<headline>Moldova inflation growth slows to 1.4 pct in Nov.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldovan consumer prices rose 1.4 percent in November, compared to 1.6 percent in October, a report from the State Statistics Department said.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN CONSUMER PRICES     Nov '96    Oct '96    Nov '95</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		  +1.4	 +1.6	 +6.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	    +17	  +23	  +24</p>
<p>Consumer prices in January-November of 1996 grew by 14.1 percent. The National Bank expects annual inflation to drop this year to 15-17 percent from 23.8 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
